  <diagram name="Auth_Flow" id="cp-60">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" background="#114B5F" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="cp-33" value='&lt;font style="font-size: 30px;" color="#FFFFFF"&gt;&lt;b&gt;OPNsense Captive Portal - Client Authentication Flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;' style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1200" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-34" value='&lt;font style="font-size: 15px;" color="#E4FDE1"&gt;What happens from the moment a guest device joins the SSID until it has Internet access.&lt;/font&gt;' style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="60" width="1200" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-35" value='&lt;font style="font-size: 20px;" color="#F2A541"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Guest Client&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;' style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="110" width="300" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-36" value='&lt;font style="font-size: 20px;" color="#F45B69"&gt;&lt;b&gt;OPNsense (GUEST interface)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;' style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="460" y="110" width="300" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-37" value='&lt;font style="font-size: 20px;" color="#B388FF"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Auth Backend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;' style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="860" y="110" width="300" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-38" value='&lt;font style="font-size: 16px;" color="#FFFFFF"&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Join Guest SSID&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 13px;" color="#E4FDE1"&gt;Device associates with the AP on VLAN 50&lt;/font&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2A541;strokeColor=#E4FDE1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=14;arcSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="170" width="300" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-39" value='&lt;font style="font-size: 16px;" color="#FFFFFF"&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. DHCP lease&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 13px;" color="#E4FDE1"&gt;192.168.50.x handed out by OPNsense DHCPv4. DNS = 192.168.50.1 (Unbound)&lt;/font&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F45B69;strokeColor=#E4FDE1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=14;arcSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="460" y="270" width="300" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-40" value="DHCP Discover / Offer" style="edgeStyle=none;shape=connector;curved=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#F2A541;strokeWidth=3;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#FFFFFF;labelBackgroundColor=#114B5F;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startSize=14;endSize=14;sourcePerimeterSpacing=8;targetPerimeterSpacing=8;" parent="1" source="cp-38" target="cp-39" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-41" value='&lt;font style="font-size: 16px;" color="#FFFFFF"&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. First web request&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12px;" color="#E4FDE1"&gt;Browser or OS connectivity check (captive.apple.com, connectivitycheck.gstatic.com, msftconnecttest.com)&lt;/font&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2A541;strokeColor=#E4FDE1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=14;arcSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="370" width="300" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-42" value='&lt;font style="font-size: 16px;" color="#FFFFFF"&gt;&lt;b&gt;4. Intercept + redirect&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12px;" color="#E4FDE1"&gt;Unauthenticated MAC/IP: ipfw diverts TCP 80 to portal on :8000 (HTTPS :8001). Client is sent a 302 to the login page.&lt;/font&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F45B69;strokeColor=#E4FDE1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=14;arcSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="460" y="470" width="300" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-43" value="HTTP GET" style="edgeStyle=none;shape=connector;curved=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#F2A541;strokeWidth=3;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#FFFFFF;labelBackgroundColor=#114B5F;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startSize=14;endSize=14;sourcePerimeterSpacing=8;targetPerimeterSpacing=8;" parent="1" source="cp-41" target="cp-42" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-44" value='&lt;font style="font-size: 16px;" color="#FFFFFF"&gt;&lt;b&gt;5. Login page shown&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12px;" color="#E4FDE1"&gt;OS detects captive network and opens the sign-in sheet. Guest enters voucher / credentials or accepts terms.&lt;/font&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2A541;strokeColor=#E4FDE1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=14;arcSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="570" width="300" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-45" value="302 -&gt; https://portal:8001/" style="edgeStyle=none;shape=connector;curved=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#F45B69;strokeWidth=3;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#FFFFFF;labelBackgroundColor=#114B5F;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startSize=14;endSize=14;sourcePerimeterSpacing=8;targetPerimeterSpacing=8;" parent="1" source="cp-42" target="cp-44" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-46" value='&lt;font style="font-size: 16px;" color="#FFFFFF"&gt;&lt;b&gt;6. Validate credentials&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12px;" color="#E4FDE1"&gt;Zone authentication method decides: Voucher (local DB), Local users, RADIUS, LDAP, or none (splash only).&lt;/font&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F45B69;strokeColor=#E4FDE1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=14;arcSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="460" y="670" width="300" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-47" value="POST user / password / voucher" style="edgeStyle=none;shape=connector;curved=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#F2A541;strokeWidth=3;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#FFFFFF;labelBackgroundColor=#114B5F;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startSize=14;endSize=14;sourcePerimeterSpacing=8;targetPerimeterSpacing=8;" parent="1" source="cp-44" target="cp-46" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-48" value='&lt;font style="font-size: 16px;" color="#FFFFFF"&gt;&lt;b&gt;RADIUS / LDAP (optional)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12px;" color="#E4FDE1"&gt;Access-Request -&gt; Access-Accept. Session-Timeout and bandwidth attributes can be returned.&lt;/font&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#5E35B1;strokeColor=#E4FDE1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=14;arcSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="860" y="670" width="300" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-49" value="UDP 1812" style="edgeStyle=none;shape=connector;curved=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#B388FF;strokeWidth=3;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#FFFFFF;labelBackgroundColor=#114B5F;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startSize=14;endSize=14;sourcePerimeterSpacing=8;targetPerimeterSpacing=8;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 8;" parent="1" source="cp-46" target="cp-48" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-50" value='&lt;font style="font-size: 16px;" color="#FFFFFF"&gt;&lt;b&gt;7. Session created&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12px;" color="#E4FDE1"&gt;Client MAC + IP added to the allowed table. Firewall now passes guest -&gt; WAN. Accounting start sent if RADIUS.&lt;/font&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F45B69;strokeColor=#E4FDE1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=14;arcSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="460" y="770" width="300" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-51" value="accept" style="edgeStyle=none;shape=connector;curved=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#05F034;strokeWidth=3;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#FFFFFF;labelBackgroundColor=#114B5F;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startSize=14;endSize=14;sourcePerimeterSpacing=8;targetPerimeterSpacing=8;" parent="1" source="cp-46" target="cp-50" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-52" value='&lt;font style="font-size: 16px;" color="#FFFFFF"&gt;&lt;b&gt;8. Online&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 13px;" color="#E4FDE1"&gt;Redirected to the original URL or the configured landing page. Normal browsing works.&lt;/font&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1B7F3B;strokeColor=#E4FDE1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=14;arcSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="870" width="300" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-53" value="Session OK" style="edgeStyle=none;shape=connector;curved=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#05F034;strokeWidth=3;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#FFFFFF;labelBackgroundColor=#114B5F;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startSize=14;endSize=14;sourcePerimeterSpacing=8;targetPerimeterSpacing=8;" parent="1" source="cp-50" target="cp-52" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-54" value='&lt;font style="font-size: 16px;" color="#FFFFFF"&gt;&lt;b&gt;9. Session ends&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12px;" color="#E4FDE1"&gt;Idle timeout, hard timeout, voucher expiry, or manual logout (Services &gt; Captive Portal &gt; Sessions). Client is back to step 4.&lt;/font&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#7A1F2B;strokeColor=#E4FDE1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=14;arcSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="460" y="970" width="300" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-55" value="timeout / logout" style="edgeStyle=none;shape=connector;curved=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#FF0000;strokeWidth=3;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#FFFFFF;labelBackgroundColor=#114B5F;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startSize=14;endSize=14;sourcePerimeterSpacing=8;targetPerimeterSpacing=8;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 8;" parent="1" source="cp-52" target="cp-54" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-56" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;shape=connector;curved=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#FF0000;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#FFFFFF;labelBackgroundColor=#114B5F;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startSize=14;endSize=14;sourcePerimeterSpacing=8;targetPerimeterSpacing=8;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 8;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="cp-54" target="cp-42" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="820" y="1005.0" />
              <mxPoint x="820" y="505.0" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-57" value='&lt;font style="font-size: 17px;" color="#FFFFFF"&gt;&lt;b&gt;OPNsense setup checklist&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 13px;" color="#E4FDE1"&gt;1. Interfaces &gt; Assignments: add VLAN 50 on the LAN parent, name it GUEST&lt;br&gt;2. Interfaces &gt; GUEST: static 192.168.50.1/24&lt;br&gt;3. Services &gt; DHCPv4 &gt; GUEST: range 192.168.50.100-250&lt;br&gt;4. Services &gt; Captive Portal &gt; Administration: new zone&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;- Interfaces: GUEST&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;- Authenticate using: Voucher / Local / RADIUS&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;- Idle / hard timeout, concurrent logins&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;- Allowed addresses: DNS, NTP, update servers&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;- Template: custom HTML/CSS zip (optional)&lt;br&gt;5. System &gt; Trust: cert for portal HTTPS (:8001)&lt;br&gt;6. Firewall &gt; Rules &gt; GUEST:&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;- Block GUEST net -&gt; RFC1918 / LAN net&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;- Pass GUEST net -&gt; any (Internet)&lt;br&gt;7. Services &gt; Captive Portal &gt; Vouchers: create a provider + roll&lt;br&gt;8. Test with a phone on the Guest SSID&lt;/font&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0E3A4A;strokeColor=#E4FDE1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=16;arcSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="860" y="780" width="360" height="420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cp-58" value='&lt;font style="font-size: 17px;" color="#FFFFFF"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gotchas&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 13px;" color="#E4FDE1"&gt;- HTTPS sites cannot be redirected; rely on OS captive detection&lt;br&gt;- Whitelist the portal cert CA or use a public cert to avoid warnings&lt;br&gt;- Unbound must answer on the GUEST interface or detection fails&lt;br&gt;- Captive portal uses :8000 / :8001 - do not reuse for other services&lt;br&gt;- MAC randomization on phones means a new session per connect&lt;/font&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0E3A4A;strokeColor=#F2A541;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=16;arcSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="860" y="1230" width="360" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
